                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I walked in and saw the photos of fried dough sticks, preserved eggs, and egg pancakes on the wall. They looked so unique, I immediately ordered some to try. The fried dough sticks were crispy, the preserved eggs were chewy, and the egg pancakes were quite flaky. They even added bonito flakes; overall, the taste was pretty good. The Americano was a bit weak.",
